window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A bloody past has long claws, and no one is safe…</b></p> <p>With the ink still drying on her Quantico diploma, FBI Special Agent Allie Bishop finds herself thrust into her very first case. A series of gruesome murders has rocked her hometown community of Gig Harbor, WA, and Allie has been entrusted with finding the villain.</p> <p>She's spent years clawing her way out of her father's evil shadow. No longer the frightened young girl who stumbled onto his brutal crimes, Allie must uncover a sinister evil lurking within the corridors of her old high school.</p> <p>But it quickly becomes clear that her new partner isn't interested in having a rookie around, and soon enough he leaves her to sink or swim on her own. Meanwhile, the mutilated bodies of beloved students continue to pile up, and no one seems all too interested in helping.</p> <p>As Allie navigates the challenges and pitfalls of a new career, her past rears its dark and malicious head, threatening to swallow her whole.</p> <p>The past does not easily forget</p> <p>And family is forever...</p> <p><i>Don't miss this much-anticipated series from bestselling author Eva Sparks. Join FBI Special Agent Allie Bishop on a thrilling ride, where darkness lurks around every corner, and danger is just a heartbeat away…</i></p>"; 
